Adds the container runtime and CLI tools this project needs to ~/.dotfiles.

Apply from ~/.dotfiles:
    cd ~/.dotfiles
    git apply --check ~/Projects/personal-organizer/docs/nixos-docker.patch
    git apply         ~/Projects/personal-organizer/docs/nixos-docker.patch
    sudo nixos-rebuild switch --flake ~/.dotfiles

IMPORTANT: docker group membership only takes effect after a full re-login (log
out and back in, or reboot). Until then `docker ps` fails with a permission
error on the socket.

Note home.nix uses CRLF line endings and this patch preserves them.

None of this is needed for the unit tests -- only the database tests, which
skip cleanly without a server.

diff --git a/configuration.nix b/configuration.nix
index cff34ea..ae8a2c6 100644
--- a/configuration.nix
+++ b/configuration.nix
@@ -25,6 +25,9 @@
     extraGroups = [
       "networkmanager"
       "wheel"
+      # Talk to the docker socket without sudo.
+      # Takes effect only after a full re-login.
+      "docker"
     ];
     shell = pkgs.zsh;
   };
@@ -32,6 +35,14 @@
   # System Shell Enablement
   programs.zsh.enable = true;
 
+  # Container runtime. Used only for the local test database of
+  # ~/Projects/personal-organizer (docker-compose.yml); staging and production
+  # databases live on Railway.
+  virtualisation.docker = {
+    enable = true;
+    autoPrune.enable = true;
+  };
+
   # Nix & Package Management Settings
   nixpkgs.config.allowUnfree = true;
   nix.settings.experimental-features = [
diff --git a/home.nix b/home.nix
index 48dacb7..b767f7a 100644
--- a/home.nix
+++ b/home.nix
@@ -24,6 +24,11 @@
 
   home.packages = with pkgs; [
     ripgrep
+    # personal-organizer toolchain
+    docker-compose # local Postgres (pgvector/pgvector:pg16) for the test suite
+    postgresql_16 # psql client, matching the server major used in production
+    railway # Railway CLI: logs, variables, shell
+    github-cli # gh: branch protection, PRs, CI runs
     nautilus
     claude-code
     capitaine-cursors
